Metavariable P:Statement
Metavariable Q:Statement
Metavariable R:Statement

Rule (DoubleConjunctionIntroduction)
  Premises
    P
    Q
    R
  Conclusion
    P ∧ Q  ∧ R

Rule (DoubleConjunctionLeftElimination)
  Premise
    P ∧ Q  ∧ R
  Conclusion
    P

Rule (DoubleConjunctionMiddleElimination)
  Premise
    P ∧ Q  ∧ R
  Conclusion
    Q

Rule (DoubleConjunctionRightElimination)
  Premise
    P ∧ Q  ∧ R
  Conclusion
    R
